    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n9103" root="حمس" body-key="H">
    
      5 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تحمّس</span></b>  <i>He acted,</i> or <i>behaved, with forced hardness, firmness, strictness,</i> or <i>rigour,</i> (S, A, Mgh,) in
his religion. (A, Mgh, K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <i>He</i> (a man) <i>feigned
disobedience;</i> syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَعَاصَى</span>. (S, TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <i>He protected,</i> or <i>defended, himself,</i> (syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَحَرَّمَ</span>,) <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بِهِ</span> by
<i>means of him.</i> (Sh, TA.)

